WEBVTT

01:30.520 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.380 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 42]

01:39.039 --> 01:41.590
We'll do as Your Highness says.

01:42.039 --> 01:43.000
Very well.

01:44.789 --> 01:45.759
Issue my order:

01:47.870 --> 01:49.600
submerge the inks for testing.

01:54.250 --> 01:56.430
[Sihe Ink]

02:34.960 --> 02:36.030
Today

02:37.120 --> 02:39.560
is the fifth day of the immersion test,

02:40.079 --> 02:42.079
and the outcome remains undecided.

02:42.240 --> 02:43.000
Renkichi,

02:43.930 --> 02:45.490
are you confident

02:45.750 --> 02:47.630
your method will prevail?

02:49.590 --> 02:51.450
Please rest assured, Mr. Kuroda.

02:51.590 --> 02:53.520
Long before we came to Ming,

02:53.520 --> 02:55.850
we'd already conducted immersion tests.

02:56.150 --> 02:57.560
Even if our Sihe Ink

02:57.680 --> 03:00.030
remains submerged for 15 days,

03:00.120 --> 03:00.920
it will emerge

03:01.080 --> 03:02.280
completely intact.

03:12.400 --> 03:13.560
I see.

03:16.680 --> 03:18.800
But what if the Li family's Liuhe Ink

03:19.000 --> 03:20.870
can also last

03:21.190 --> 03:22.150
for 15 days?

03:22.590 --> 03:23.630
I have

03:24.190 --> 03:26.120
a countermeasure for that as well.

03:46.100 --> 03:47.870
Day 10 of the immersion test,

03:46.300 --> 03:48.970
[Literary Association]

03:47.980 --> 03:49.190
present the inks!

04:15.250 --> 04:17.600
[Wor...]

04:18.269 --> 04:21.709
[World]

04:39.830 --> 04:40.720
Wenqian,

04:41.310 --> 04:43.310
your pacing is making me so anxious.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.750
Your Highness,

04:46.140 --> 04:47.460
the two inks

04:47.510 --> 04:49.430
remain evenly matched.

04:53.390 --> 04:54.480
Your Highness,

04:55.750 --> 04:57.310
the immersion test

04:57.430 --> 04:59.240
originated with Li Ink.

04:59.890 --> 05:02.630
We're merely the younger generation
following in their footsteps.

05:02.630 --> 05:05.680
That Li Ink has not won by now
is itself a defeat.

05:05.750 --> 05:06.830
In my opinion,

05:08.190 --> 05:10.520
there is no need to continue this contest.

05:10.840 --> 05:13.070
What a completely
unreasonable thing to say, Renkichi.

05:13.070 --> 05:15.120
The ink made
by our family's ancestors remained

05:15.120 --> 05:18.560
completely undamaged even after being
submerged in water for a whole year.

05:18.560 --> 05:22.120
And now you wish to decide victory
after a mere 10 days?

05:22.390 --> 05:24.160
Isn't that far too frivolous?

05:25.680 --> 05:26.630
In my opinion,

05:27.060 --> 05:28.250
if you want the title

05:28.270 --> 05:30.120
of "Finest Ink Under Heaven" so badly,

05:30.120 --> 05:31.430
why not just go home,

05:31.480 --> 05:33.680
carve yourself a plaque, and hang it up?

05:33.920 --> 05:36.600
Why waste everyone's time here?

05:36.680 --> 05:37.810
Wouldn't you agree?

05:37.950 --> 05:38.630
You...

05:38.920 --> 05:39.830
Renkichi.

05:47.430 --> 05:48.720
Your Highness,

05:49.310 --> 05:50.870
we came to your country

05:51.159 --> 05:53.430
to exchange knowledge
of the art of ink-making.

05:53.430 --> 05:57.680
If this immersion test continues
without a result,

05:58.120 --> 05:59.630
are we just going to

05:59.800 --> 06:02.070
drag this out endlessly?

06:02.510 --> 06:04.570
Then what do you suggest, Mr. Kuroda?

06:05.190 --> 06:06.390
Five more days.

06:08.160 --> 06:09.390
If after five days

06:10.040 --> 06:12.000
there is still no clear winner,

06:12.360 --> 06:14.510
then victory shall go to my ink.

06:14.750 --> 06:15.610
How about that?

06:23.120 --> 06:24.270
Manager Li,

06:25.750 --> 06:27.610
do you dare accept the challenge?

06:32.310 --> 06:33.240
Li Zhen,

06:33.830 --> 06:36.040
do not lose the spirit of our Hui Ink!

06:36.430 --> 06:37.600
Your Highness,

06:38.040 --> 06:38.920
I

06:39.430 --> 06:40.240
accept.

06:41.680 --> 06:42.600
Very well!

06:42.970 --> 06:45.880
Liuhe Ink and Sihe Ink are still
evenly matched!

06:45.920 --> 06:48.450
The final judgment
shall be made in five days!

06:49.159 --> 06:50.600
Another five days?

07:31.800 --> 07:32.630
Zhen,

07:33.360 --> 07:34.310
today

07:34.510 --> 07:36.830
is the decisive battle for our Li family.

07:37.830 --> 07:39.870
The whole family will go with you.

07:40.430 --> 07:41.480
Aunt,

07:41.560 --> 07:43.920
I'll go with you.

07:44.800 --> 07:45.770
Okay.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.600
You go with me too, okay?

07:47.620 --> 07:48.420
Okay.

08:00.310 --> 08:01.070
Zhen,

08:02.600 --> 08:04.750
your father and grandfather

08:05.600 --> 08:07.530
are watching over you from heaven.

08:09.240 --> 08:10.640
There's nothing to fear.

08:11.270 --> 08:12.480
We will go together.

08:15.680 --> 08:16.870
Our whole family

08:18.390 --> 08:19.390
will go together.

08:28.190 --> 08:29.510
I, Wenqian, shall

08:30.190 --> 08:31.190
go with you all.

08:35.510 --> 08:37.549
Day 15 of the immersion test,

08:37.750 --> 08:39.360
present the inks!

09:13.200 --> 09:15.120
Judges,

09:15.240 --> 09:17.570
please step forward and examine the inks.

09:34.510 --> 09:38.600
Lord Yan, Lord He,
please step forward and examine the inks.

09:57.840 --> 09:59.080
How is it this time?

09:59.960 --> 10:01.240
The same as before.

10:05.840 --> 10:07.000
Your Highness,

10:07.270 --> 10:08.550
you gave your word.

10:08.630 --> 10:10.030
If the immersion test

10:10.030 --> 10:11.270
lasted 15 days

10:11.270 --> 10:12.930
and still produced no winner,

10:13.200 --> 10:15.800
then victory would belong to
our family's ink.

10:31.510 --> 10:33.150
Your Highness,

10:33.360 --> 10:35.420
something is wrong with the Sihe Ink!

10:37.800 --> 10:38.490
Go take a look.

10:38.490 --> 10:39.180
Go.

10:50.480 --> 10:52.150
Your Highness,

10:52.510 --> 10:55.670
there is indeed something wrong
with the Sihe Ink.

10:57.360 --> 10:58.320
Impossible!

10:58.790 --> 11:00.960
We tested our Sihe Ink long ago.

11:00.960 --> 11:03.750
It could never be damaged
after only 15 days underwater!

11:03.750 --> 11:04.840
It's you.

11:05.030 --> 11:06.550
You tampered with it!

11:06.550 --> 11:07.240
Insolent!

11:07.790 --> 11:11.320
How dare you question
the impartiality of the Princess of Ming?

11:11.600 --> 11:13.060
Where do you think you are?

11:13.360 --> 11:16.120
This is the Literary Association
of the Huizhou ink industry!

11:16.120 --> 11:17.670
Above us stand the gods as witnesses,

11:17.670 --> 11:19.240
and below us stand Ming guards,

11:19.240 --> 11:21.960
jointly overseeing the inks
alongside your Kuroda family!

11:21.960 --> 11:23.550
Who could have tampered with it?

11:23.550 --> 11:25.000
Who would dare?

11:25.030 --> 11:26.870
Then how do you explain that the ink

11:26.870 --> 11:29.360
showed no damage whatsoever
when we tested it underwater in Japan?

11:29.360 --> 11:30.670
May I ask you two,

11:30.840 --> 11:32.240
since you've already conducted tests

11:32.240 --> 11:34.240
proving your Sihe Ink didn't deteriorate
when submerged,

11:34.240 --> 11:35.030
were those tests carried out

11:35.030 --> 11:36.910
by sinking the ink into a pond

11:37.080 --> 11:39.320
as per the ancient method?

11:39.550 --> 11:40.720
Yes, and what of it?

11:41.240 --> 11:42.390
Your Highness,

11:42.670 --> 11:43.630
I know

11:43.630 --> 11:46.150
why the Sihe Ink deteriorated.

11:47.360 --> 11:50.000
You submerged your ink in a pond.

11:50.390 --> 11:52.390
A pond is deep and wide;

11:52.480 --> 11:54.480
its waters are cold
and maintain a stable temperature,

11:54.480 --> 11:57.360
which naturally preserves
the ink intact for 15 days.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.320
But this time,

11:58.750 --> 12:01.440
we used water jars for the test.

12:02.000 --> 12:04.000
The jars are shallow and narrow,

12:04.240 --> 12:06.720
and moreover, they've been exposed
day and night outdoors.

12:06.720 --> 12:08.240
Huizhou is a mountainous region.

12:08.240 --> 12:11.000
The scorching daytime heat
warms the water in the jars,

12:11.000 --> 12:13.360
while the freezing night air chills it.

12:13.630 --> 12:15.750
Your ink has been subjected to
this repeated alternation

12:15.750 --> 12:16.910
of heat and cold

12:17.080 --> 12:19.390
and has gradually deteriorated
as a result.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.510
Unfair...

12:21.120 --> 12:22.080
This is unfair.

12:22.840 --> 12:24.270
You're familiar with
the climate in Huizhou

12:24.270 --> 12:25.960
and deliberately accounted for
the temperature fluctuations.

12:25.960 --> 12:27.080
I refuse to accept this!

12:27.080 --> 12:29.360
The temperature changes
are merely external factors.

12:29.360 --> 12:31.200
The true cause of the ink's deterioration

12:31.200 --> 12:32.110
lies

12:32.430 --> 12:33.720
within the ink itself.

12:34.440 --> 12:37.200
Your Sihe Ink uses 1000-year-old pine—

12:37.240 --> 12:39.670
the soot made from it is extraordinary,

12:39.870 --> 12:41.910
a rarity even in Huizhou.

12:42.390 --> 12:43.870
But too much of a good thing
can become a bad thing.

12:43.870 --> 12:45.240
The older the pine, the harder it is

12:45.240 --> 12:47.150
for the soot it produces
to bond with the glue.

12:47.150 --> 12:50.120
Plus, with repeated
heating and cooling underwater,

12:50.120 --> 12:53.320
the glue and soot in the ink
naturally separate over time.

12:54.000 --> 12:55.840
However, our family's Liuhe Ink

12:56.320 --> 12:57.840
uses common pine.

12:57.910 --> 13:01.320
The soot it produces has been bound
through the six-compound glue method—

13:01.320 --> 13:03.870
soot and glue have been completely fused,

13:04.030 --> 13:05.510
making it impervious to heat and cold.

13:05.510 --> 13:07.670
Even if submerged for one

13:07.720 --> 13:10.510
or two months,
it remains completely undamaged.

13:10.870 --> 13:13.030
You proposed this method of testing ink

13:13.030 --> 13:15.360
because you'd already tested it yourselves
and felt confident.

13:15.360 --> 13:18.270
You then lured us in step by step
until we took the bait.

13:18.270 --> 13:19.150
But in the end,

13:19.240 --> 13:21.550
you only shot yourselves in the foot.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.510
After today's test,

13:24.080 --> 13:26.720
I think it goes without saying

13:27.030 --> 13:28.440
which is superior—

13:28.600 --> 13:29.910
Ming Hui Ink

13:30.240 --> 13:30.960
or

13:31.510 --> 13:32.600
Japanese ink.

13:34.320 --> 13:35.270
Renkichi,

13:36.150 --> 13:38.510
enough. Say no more.

13:45.790 --> 13:47.670
Your Highness,

13:48.720 --> 13:50.380
in this water immersion test,

13:50.670 --> 13:52.080
the Kuroda family

13:52.910 --> 13:53.790
admits defeat.

13:59.320 --> 14:00.670
The Hui Ink of Ming

14:01.670 --> 14:03.530
truly lives up to its reputation.

14:04.030 --> 14:06.960
We accept the outcome.

14:12.510 --> 14:14.510
Our family's blade-forging method

14:14.550 --> 14:18.000
will be presented to
the Ming court shortly.

14:20.150 --> 14:22.150
After 15 days of the water test,

14:22.320 --> 14:23.920
the winner has been decided.

14:24.480 --> 14:26.200
The title of Finest Ink Under Heaven

14:26.200 --> 14:28.530
belongs without question to the Liuhe Ink

14:28.960 --> 14:30.390
of Ming's Li family!

14:34.200 --> 14:36.120
Congratulations to His Majesty!

14:36.120 --> 14:38.120
Congratulations to Your Highness!

14:38.150 --> 14:41.670
Long live the Emperor!

14:41.750 --> 14:45.600
Long live the Princess!

14:50.320 --> 14:52.390
The Li family's Liuhe Ink has won

14:52.510 --> 14:55.080
and has been granted the title
"Finest Ink Under Heaven!"

14:55.080 --> 14:57.390
Wonderful! Wonderful!

15:16.440 --> 15:19.670
"Gold may be easy to come by,
but Li Ink is hard to find!"

15:19.870 --> 15:24.080
By imperial decree, Li Ink is granted
the title of Finest Ink Under Heaven!

15:24.510 --> 15:27.790
"Gold may be easy to come by,
but Li Ink is hard to find."

15:28.030 --> 15:32.270
By imperial decree, Li Ink is granted
the title of Finest Ink Under Heaven!

15:32.600 --> 15:36.000
"Gold may be easy to come by,
but Li Ink is hard to find!"

15:36.270 --> 15:40.910
By imperial decree, Li Ink is granted
the title of Finest Ink Under Heaven!

15:41.410 --> 15:45.050
"Gold may be easy to come by,
but Li Ink is hard to find!"

15:45.240 --> 15:49.870
By imperial decree, Li Ink is granted
the title of Finest Ink Under Heaven!

15:51.910 --> 15:52.970
Congratulations!

15:55.720 --> 15:57.150
Congratulations! Congratulations!

15:57.150 --> 15:58.240
Thank you.

15:58.830 --> 16:00.310
There's one for everyone!

16:02.030 --> 16:04.230
Congratulations on winning the title!

16:20.080 --> 16:20.960
Everyone,

16:21.650 --> 16:24.170
this time, Li Ink has won

16:24.190 --> 16:26.340
the title of Finest Ink Under Heaven.

16:26.550 --> 16:27.440
We shall now

16:27.940 --> 16:29.390
formally bestow the plaque
granted by His Majesty,

16:29.390 --> 16:31.310
inscribed with "Finest Ink Under Heaven,"

16:29.460 --> 16:31.220
[Finest Ink Under Heaven]

16:31.600 --> 16:33.440
to the Li Ink!

16:34.790 --> 16:36.720
Li Ink thanks His Majesty.

16:36.720 --> 16:37.480
Thank you.

16:37.750 --> 16:38.550
Congratulations to Li Ink.

16:38.550 --> 16:39.240
Manager Zhen.

16:39.240 --> 16:39.960
Thank you.

16:39.960 --> 16:43.270
Your contributions in this Tribute Ink selection
have been immense

16:43.270 --> 16:46.470
and have brought great honor
to our Huizhou ink industry.

16:46.790 --> 16:50.030
You should receive this plaque
on behalf of the Li family.

16:50.630 --> 16:51.320
Zhen,

16:51.440 --> 16:52.550
go up and accept it.

17:10.069 --> 17:11.869
Elders and seniors of the craft,

17:12.440 --> 17:14.300
the success of Liuhe Ink this time

17:14.510 --> 17:16.960
is by no means
the credit of our family alone,

17:16.960 --> 17:19.069
but the result of the concerted efforts

17:19.069 --> 17:21.329
of all peers in the Huizhou ink industry.

17:21.480 --> 17:22.750
The Liuhe Ink contains

17:23.270 --> 17:25.530
our family's Sihe Ink as its foundation,

17:26.069 --> 17:28.730
along with the Luo family's
ink-mixing method,

17:28.830 --> 17:30.760
the Chen family's glue technique,

17:30.790 --> 17:32.400
the Pan family's ink recipes,

17:32.400 --> 17:34.660
the Xi family's stone mortar and pestle,

17:35.270 --> 17:37.030
and the precious medicinal ingredients

17:37.030 --> 17:39.270
from Manager Huang and President Hu.

17:40.510 --> 17:41.920
Every step of its creation was built upon

17:41.920 --> 17:44.520
the painstaking effort
and dedication of all.

17:45.720 --> 17:48.510
And when my grandfather used his own blood
to mix the ink in the end,

17:48.510 --> 17:51.000
what he bound was not merely
a block of ink,

17:51.720 --> 17:55.380
but the unity of Hui Ink
and the eternal inheritance of its spirit.

17:56.510 --> 17:57.270
Therefore,

17:57.720 --> 17:59.980
this plaque of "Finest Ink Under Heaven"

18:00.510 --> 18:02.770
should not belong solely to the Li family

18:02.830 --> 18:05.400
but hang permanently
in the Literary Association

18:05.400 --> 18:07.200
so that all Huizhou ink artisans

18:07.270 --> 18:08.930
may share this honor forever.

18:09.830 --> 18:10.480
Well...

18:12.640 --> 18:13.510
Zhen,

18:13.680 --> 18:15.830
this plaque was hard-won.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.030
Are you truly

18:17.350 --> 18:18.640
not going to keep it?

18:19.440 --> 18:20.240
President Hu,

18:21.070 --> 18:22.550
this is the result of a decision

18:22.550 --> 18:24.310
made collectively by our entire Li family.

18:24.310 --> 18:25.960
It was not made on impulse.

18:27.270 --> 18:28.480
Furthermore,

18:28.960 --> 18:32.430
we've divided the Liuhe Ink into portions

18:32.960 --> 18:35.400
to present to
each ink-making family in Huizhou.

18:35.400 --> 18:37.200
It's a symbol that all of us
in the Huizhou ink industry

18:37.200 --> 18:38.600
spring from the same root

18:38.750 --> 18:40.680
and are nourished by the same land.

18:41.510 --> 18:42.310
I believe

18:43.640 --> 18:46.680
this is also what my grandfather,
watching over us from beyond,

18:46.680 --> 18:48.160
truly wished to see.

18:51.480 --> 18:52.440
Zhen,

18:53.030 --> 18:54.640
we can all feel the generosity of spirit

18:54.640 --> 18:56.160
behind your intentions.

18:57.310 --> 19:00.770
Today, the Huizhou ink industry
accepts the kindness of Li Ink

19:01.400 --> 19:02.720
and will certainly, as you wish,

19:02.720 --> 19:04.640
continue to develop and grow stronger.

19:04.640 --> 19:05.790
It's just that you

19:06.400 --> 19:07.680
and your Li family

19:08.160 --> 19:09.560
have gone through so much

19:09.790 --> 19:11.200
yet kept nothing for yourselves.

19:11.200 --> 19:12.720
Wouldn't that be a pity?

19:12.750 --> 19:13.640
Indeed.

19:16.400 --> 19:17.550
Respected elders,

19:18.200 --> 19:19.800
if we are to speak of regrets,

19:20.310 --> 19:22.110
I do have one request.

19:24.030 --> 19:24.920
I

19:25.770 --> 19:26.990
would like to take back the tooth

19:26.990 --> 19:30.270
my grandfather knocked out
and drove into the pillar to seal his vow.

19:30.270 --> 19:32.660
My grandfather has now given his life
for his craft

19:32.660 --> 19:34.340
and held fast to his Way of Ink.

19:35.480 --> 19:36.960
The vow he swore

19:37.920 --> 19:39.050
and the blood he shed

19:40.240 --> 19:43.100
have all become memories,
dissipating like smoke.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.510
And this tooth

19:48.350 --> 19:49.480
should also

19:50.240 --> 19:51.350
go with him.

19:52.550 --> 19:54.350
It should no longer remain here.

19:55.680 --> 19:57.070
I want my grandfather

19:57.720 --> 19:59.650
to return home whole and complete.

20:00.510 --> 20:03.340
I ask all elders here
to grant me this wish.

20:07.000 --> 20:07.880
Zhen,

20:08.240 --> 20:09.640
how could we not grant

20:09.750 --> 20:11.310
such an act of filial devotion?

20:11.310 --> 20:12.270
You're right.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.640
We should let Eighth Master Li

20:14.640 --> 20:16.960
return home whole and complete.

22:24.630 --> 22:33.310
[Li Residence]

22:33.520 --> 22:34.920
The path of ink-making is

22:35.920 --> 22:37.780
full of hardships and obstacles.

22:38.180 --> 22:39.750
Can you endure them?

22:40.720 --> 22:42.580
I'm willing to endure hardships!

22:43.240 --> 22:43.790
Good.

22:45.160 --> 22:48.110
I, Li Jinshui, inheritor of
the Li's Ink-making technique,

22:48.110 --> 22:51.720
take Zhen of the Li family
as my apprentice

22:53.160 --> 22:55.920
to pass on the art of ink-making.

22:57.310 --> 23:00.400
May the Founding Master bless
her path in ink-making,

23:01.070 --> 23:02.440
smooth and prosperous,

23:03.480 --> 23:05.540
and true to her original aspiration.

23:06.720 --> 23:07.680
For others,

23:08.030 --> 23:10.070
the first step in making ink
might be making lampblack.

23:10.070 --> 23:11.070
But for you,

23:11.440 --> 23:13.570
you must start by twisting lamp wicks.

23:13.590 --> 23:15.200
The path of ink-making

23:16.310 --> 23:18.310
is full of hardships and obstacles.

23:18.880 --> 23:20.790
We grind the ink, and the ink

23:21.240 --> 23:22.480
shapes us in return.

23:23.590 --> 23:25.250
What I want to pass on to you...

23:28.510 --> 23:29.720
is the Way of Ink.

23:30.590 --> 23:31.440
The Way of Ink?

23:38.030 --> 23:39.830
To remain upright and honorable

23:40.510 --> 23:42.000
is the Li family's Way.

23:43.270 --> 23:45.070
To live and die alongside the ink

23:45.350 --> 23:47.160
was Luo Wensong's Way.

23:51.440 --> 23:53.400
I truly hope

23:54.310 --> 23:55.270
that one day

23:57.000 --> 23:59.310
you can find your own Way.

24:19.600 --> 24:26.830
♪ She sits before a bronze mirror,
her rouge setting off the red of her robe ♪

24:23.350 --> 24:26.030
White Jade Light is the Luo family's ink.

24:27.670 --> 24:33.160
♪ Gray walls and blue bricks
stretch for miles ♪

24:28.000 --> 24:29.350
Scholar Ink

24:30.160 --> 24:31.560
is the Chen family's ink.

24:34.200 --> 24:36.240
Then what is our family's ink called?

24:35.460 --> 24:41.860
♪ A lone goose descends;
a solitary bloom stirs ♪

24:36.510 --> 24:38.370
Cloud-Descending Mountain Ink.

24:40.270 --> 24:41.070
Grandfather,

24:41.350 --> 24:42.680
when I grow up,

24:42.720 --> 24:44.400
I want to make my own ink too.

24:42.820 --> 24:49.110
♪ The world bustles on,
yet my return remains uncertain ♪

24:44.680 --> 24:47.480
Then let Grandfather
think carefully about that.

24:56.340 --> 25:03.380
♪ With ink as the cure,
it paints my beauty anew ♪

25:03.930 --> 25:11.320
♪ With ink as the remedy,
it mends my wounded heart ♪

25:11.550 --> 25:18.950
♪ With ink as my raiment,
it grants me glory ♪

25:19.070 --> 25:28.770
♪ With ink as my obsession,
I unleash the light within my heart ♪

25:47.240 --> 25:53.790
♪ Ink-kissed beauty outshines jade,
its hue pure to behold ♪

25:54.940 --> 26:00.980
♪ My heart remains true
to where it first began ♪

26:02.480 --> 26:09.130
♪ Born with a surname bestowed,
grown into a name of my own ♪

26:10.280 --> 26:17.880
♪ Like a gentle drizzle,
it softly nourishes my soul ♪

26:14.590 --> 26:16.230
Grandfather, I've rolled it.

26:16.230 --> 26:17.290
Uneven thickness.

26:17.510 --> 26:18.200
Do it again.

26:20.250 --> 26:27.880
♪ With ink as the cure,
it paints my beauty anew ♪

26:25.000 --> 26:25.800
Grandfather.

26:26.550 --> 26:27.750
I've rolled it again.

26:27.900 --> 26:35.120
♪ With ink as the remedy,
it mends my wounded heart ♪

26:29.480 --> 26:32.080
Not tight enough.
One pull, and it falls apart.

26:32.200 --> 26:32.960
Do it again.

26:34.550 --> 26:36.000
Fine. I'll do it again.

26:35.310 --> 26:42.660
♪ With ink as my raiment,
it grants me glory ♪

26:43.260 --> 26:52.070
♪ With ink as my obsession,
I unleash the light within my heart ♪

26:47.920 --> 26:48.960
Grandfather...

26:50.750 --> 26:51.750
Grandfather...

26:54.470 --> 27:06.410
♪ Rooted in love, all things flourish ♪

27:46.750 --> 27:47.640
Allow me

27:47.830 --> 27:49.160
to propose a toast.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.270
This cup

27:51.440 --> 27:53.370
is raised in honor of the Li family.

27:53.590 --> 27:56.200
If you hadn't won the selection this time,

27:56.350 --> 27:58.400
how could I have retired from court

27:58.480 --> 28:00.000
with such dignity?

28:00.590 --> 28:01.550
I drink first as a gesture of respect!

28:01.550 --> 28:02.590
Thank you, Lord Yan.

28:02.590 --> 28:03.310
Thank you.

28:05.550 --> 28:06.480
Lord Yan,

28:06.920 --> 28:08.350
that's not quite right.

28:09.500 --> 28:10.790
You shouldn't still refer to them
as the Li family,

28:10.790 --> 28:12.000
but as your in-laws.

28:13.030 --> 28:14.960
Lord He is right.

28:15.400 --> 28:17.270
Actually, I've already planned

28:17.550 --> 28:18.960
that after the tribute selection,

28:18.960 --> 28:20.960
I will come to propose marriage for my son

28:20.960 --> 28:24.240
and set a wedding date
for Zhengshen and Xianglan

28:24.240 --> 28:25.200
as soon as possible.

28:25.200 --> 28:26.350
Wonderful. I'll be waiting for you.

28:26.350 --> 28:27.110
Okay.

28:28.030 --> 28:28.750
Great!

28:28.790 --> 28:31.050
Then I must share in this happy occasion.

28:31.550 --> 28:33.070
Everyone, let's raise a glass together.

28:33.070 --> 28:33.750
Come on.

28:34.160 --> 28:34.920
Cheers.

28:34.920 --> 28:35.550
Come on.

28:40.070 --> 28:41.590
Speaking of the wedding,

28:41.750 --> 28:42.680
Miss Li Zhen,

28:42.880 --> 28:45.400
you're also of marriageable age.

28:45.790 --> 28:47.440
In the past, you were too busy making ink

28:47.440 --> 28:48.880
to think about such things.

28:48.880 --> 28:49.880
Now,

28:49.940 --> 28:52.940
you've achieved fame and success.

28:53.510 --> 28:55.040
"Men should marry when they

28:55.550 --> 28:57.410
come of age, and so should women."

28:58.070 --> 29:00.670
It's time for you
to think about these matters.

29:00.680 --> 29:01.280
By the way,

29:01.720 --> 29:03.640
I have a disciple in Nanjing.

29:03.680 --> 29:05.510
His family comes from an official lineage.

29:05.510 --> 29:09.960
He's talented and of fine appearance,
well matched with her in every regard.

29:11.510 --> 29:12.400
Niece-in-law,

29:12.920 --> 29:14.750
what do you think?

29:18.510 --> 29:20.350
This is freshly stewed old duck soup.

29:20.350 --> 29:21.830
Everyone, please try some.

29:21.830 --> 29:23.510
Go ahead, everyone. Try it.

29:23.510 --> 29:24.310
Lord Qi.

29:24.680 --> 29:26.400
That's hardly fair.

29:28.640 --> 29:31.110
If Miss Li Zhen were to marry into
a family in Nanjing,

29:31.110 --> 29:34.310
wouldn't that be a tremendous loss
for us here in Huizhou?

29:35.720 --> 29:39.200
How about I present a memorial
to the provincial governor

29:39.720 --> 29:41.510
and petition His Majesty
for a marriage decree,

29:41.510 --> 29:45.200
betrothing Miss Li Zhen to a scion

29:45.310 --> 29:47.370
of an official family in our Huizhou?

29:47.680 --> 29:49.740
Surely His Majesty wouldn't refuse.

29:49.960 --> 29:52.720
You should just give up that idea.

29:53.000 --> 29:53.880
Lord He,

29:53.900 --> 29:56.030
you're even fighting me over this too?

29:56.070 --> 29:56.550
Come on.

29:56.550 --> 29:57.750
Come on, let's drink.

29:58.960 --> 29:59.790
On behalf of

30:01.240 --> 30:02.510
General Yu,

30:03.720 --> 30:05.400
I extend my congratulations
to you and the Li family,

30:05.400 --> 30:07.330
along with our deepest gratitude.

30:08.750 --> 30:10.480
Please thank General Yu for us.

30:18.350 --> 30:19.210
Try the dishes.

30:19.590 --> 30:20.920
Everyone, let's eat.

30:21.640 --> 30:22.700
Congratulations.

30:47.440 --> 30:48.720
Hurry. Come on.

30:49.400 --> 30:50.750
Come over, quickly.

31:11.870 --> 31:17.180
♪ Candlelight sways,
I swallow sorrow alone ♪

31:20.620 --> 31:26.030
♪ I write each word in slow,
desolate tone ♪

31:24.240 --> 31:26.110
These are the simplest ink recipes.

31:26.110 --> 31:28.040
They are very easy to distinguish.

31:28.430 --> 31:32.800
♪ Looking back,
the road stretches on and on ♪

31:28.550 --> 31:32.150
This one contains
plum blossom and osmanthus.

31:32.400 --> 31:34.110
It must be the Chen family's Scholar Ink,
known as

31:33.160 --> 31:37.440
♪ Still unhurt,
I drink another grief with the moon ♪

31:34.110 --> 31:37.650
"the gentleman among inks,"
symbolizing success in the imperial exams.

31:37.650 --> 31:45.190
♪ I carve past years' bonds
into the scroll of time ♪

31:39.510 --> 31:41.750
You don't know how adorable he was.

31:42.110 --> 31:43.270
At that time,

31:43.400 --> 31:45.530
I'd already considered him my friend.

31:45.670 --> 31:49.930
♪ Please turn the light
that waits in the dark ♪

31:46.590 --> 31:47.270
Friend?

31:49.310 --> 31:50.720
If you don't mind,

31:50.080 --> 31:53.940
♪ Into a new direction
after wind and frost ♪

31:51.070 --> 31:52.530
come work in Li Ink with me.

31:53.000 --> 31:53.830
I assure you

31:54.030 --> 31:55.070
that as long as I'm around,

31:54.540 --> 31:58.570
♪ Trust keeps the heart calm ♪

31:55.070 --> 31:57.110
you'll have food to eat
and a place to stay.

31:57.110 --> 31:58.160
Strangely enough,

31:58.160 --> 31:59.680
I've had nothing during this time,

31:59.070 --> 32:02.940
♪ And unconfused ♪

32:00.070 --> 32:02.110
yet it feels as though I lack nothing.

32:02.110 --> 32:03.030
I feel at peace.

32:03.260 --> 32:07.680
♪ Please let the girl I might meet again ♪

32:08.040 --> 32:12.180
♪ Be hope that fate has gently given ♪

32:08.920 --> 32:10.110
In my heart,

32:11.070 --> 32:12.590
you truly mean a lot.

32:12.420 --> 32:15.940
♪ No matter how many regrets remain ♪

32:15.310 --> 32:17.160
I don't want to lose you again.

32:16.890 --> 32:20.430
♪ In the end, all has already passed ♪

32:39.020 --> 32:43.280
♪ Please turn the light
that waits in the dark ♪

32:43.430 --> 32:47.290
♪ Into a new direction
after wind and frost ♪

32:44.110 --> 32:45.910
Luo Wenqian, listen carefully.

32:46.000 --> 32:47.200
For the person I love,

32:47.890 --> 32:51.920
♪ Trust keeps the heart calm ♪

32:48.000 --> 32:50.730
not even the end of the world
could make me give up.

32:51.290 --> 32:53.140
Whatever the verdict is tomorrow,

32:52.420 --> 32:56.290
♪ And unconfused ♪

32:53.550 --> 32:55.160
I will face it with you.

32:55.960 --> 32:57.400
Luo Wenqian!

32:56.610 --> 33:01.030
♪ Please let the girl I might meet again ♪

33:01.390 --> 33:05.530
♪ Be hope that fate has gently given ♪

33:05.770 --> 33:09.290
♪ No matter how many regrets remain ♪

33:10.240 --> 33:13.960
♪ In the end, all has already passed ♪

33:17.030 --> 33:18.240
Farewell.

33:23.200 --> 33:24.310
Take care!

34:07.110 --> 34:07.920
Zhen!

34:23.840 --> 34:24.920
Why are you here?

34:27.000 --> 34:27.880
At the banquet,

34:29.000 --> 34:31.800
everyone was trying to
arrange a marriage for you.

34:32.980 --> 34:35.239
But I don't want you to marry anyone else.

34:36.170 --> 34:38.280
I don't want to miss my chance
with you again.

34:38.280 --> 34:40.940
We've already missed each other
too many times.

34:41.800 --> 34:43.400
That year, when I was exiled,

34:44.760 --> 34:45.760
I thought

34:46.760 --> 34:48.000
from then on

34:48.760 --> 34:50.960
we would be separated
by mountains and seas forever.

34:50.960 --> 34:53.090
But later, when I returned, I realized

34:54.360 --> 34:55.360
that however high

34:55.550 --> 34:57.750
the mountains are, they can be climbed,

34:57.760 --> 34:58.760
and however vast

34:59.510 --> 35:01.320
the seas are, they can be crossed.

35:01.320 --> 35:02.110
Zhen,

35:03.320 --> 35:04.760
from this day forward,

35:05.360 --> 35:07.620
I want to cross mountains and seas for you

35:08.280 --> 35:11.210
and share every detail
of this mortal world with you.

35:17.070 --> 35:18.600
For these past three years—

35:21.230 --> 35:22.630
for the sake of my mother,

35:24.190 --> 35:25.510
my grandfather,

35:26.150 --> 35:27.510
and Uncle Jingdong—

35:29.070 --> 35:30.930
I dared not let myself think of you

35:31.400 --> 35:33.060
and couldn't allow myself to.

35:34.840 --> 35:37.700
I kept trying to
make myself forget you completely.

35:38.960 --> 35:40.320
But I realized

35:41.590 --> 35:44.520
there wasn't a single moment
when I truly forgot you.

35:46.320 --> 35:47.510
All these years,

35:49.110 --> 35:51.190
I believed it was our entire family

35:52.010 --> 35:54.340
that couldn't move on from what happened.

35:55.000 --> 35:56.550
But in the end, I realized

35:58.630 --> 36:00.800
that the only one trapped in it

36:02.110 --> 36:03.480
was me.

36:05.480 --> 36:06.710
From now on,

36:08.960 --> 36:10.510
you won't be alone anymore.

36:14.590 --> 36:16.030
If you can't accept me right now,
that's alright.

36:16.030 --> 36:17.030
I can wait.

36:18.000 --> 36:19.590
One year, three years, five years,
or ten years—

36:19.590 --> 36:20.800
I'll wait as long as it takes.

36:20.800 --> 36:21.710
What if I said

36:23.520 --> 36:26.380
I want you to stay by my side
for the rest of our lives?

36:38.880 --> 36:39.880
I will.

36:41.030 --> 36:42.110
I will.

36:44.030 --> 36:46.290
I'll stay with you
for the rest of my life.

37:05.840 --> 37:06.760
Wenqian.

37:07.330 --> 37:09.800
Cuiqiao's birthday is next month.

37:10.360 --> 37:13.220
I want to give her
this set of exquisite colored ink.

37:13.480 --> 37:14.550
What do you think?

37:15.030 --> 37:15.840
Very good.

37:16.510 --> 37:19.280
Especially this azure color—
it looks like the sea.

37:19.280 --> 37:21.080
Sister will definitely like it.

37:24.510 --> 37:26.400
What have you been drawing for so long?

37:26.400 --> 37:27.360
I was thinking

37:27.710 --> 37:29.730
of making an ink
adorned with a pair of mandarin ducks

37:29.730 --> 37:31.380
and then using that very ink

37:31.400 --> 37:33.320
to write our marriage certificate.

37:33.320 --> 37:35.070
G-Give it to me.

37:35.960 --> 37:37.710
Let me help you improve the design.

37:37.710 --> 37:38.590
Come on.

37:42.150 --> 37:42.710
Here.

37:44.590 --> 37:45.510
Look.

37:47.280 --> 37:48.190
Look.

37:48.800 --> 37:49.920
Draw it...

37:51.800 --> 37:52.590
here.

37:55.130 --> 37:56.330
Indeed, much better.

37:56.480 --> 37:57.400
Manager Zhen,

37:57.400 --> 37:58.590
Mr. Xiao is here!

37:58.710 --> 37:59.480
Jixiang?

38:00.280 --> 38:01.150
Young Master!

38:02.320 --> 38:03.190
Young Master,

38:03.400 --> 38:04.600
I heard you were here.

38:05.590 --> 38:06.320
Mr. Xiao.

38:06.510 --> 38:06.920
Miss Li Zhen.

38:06.920 --> 38:07.840
You rascal,

38:07.960 --> 38:10.280
you didn't even write to me before coming.

38:10.280 --> 38:11.080
Young Master.

38:11.110 --> 38:11.910
What's wrong?

38:17.030 --> 38:18.920
An uprising has broken out
along the Fujian and Guangdong coasts.

38:18.920 --> 38:20.250
The situation is grave.

38:20.590 --> 38:23.480
General Yu requests that you
return to camp with me immediately

38:23.480 --> 38:25.740
and assist in suppressing the uprising.

39:39.470 --> 39:40.640
Just see me off here.

39:42.710 --> 39:44.510
May you soon return triumphant.

39:45.400 --> 39:46.730
Wait for me to come back.

41:03.760 --> 41:05.920
How did Aunt teach you before?

41:06.880 --> 41:07.710
Look,

41:07.710 --> 41:10.150
we have to twist
the lamp wick first, right?

41:10.480 --> 41:12.280
Then keep rolling it like this.

41:12.280 --> 41:12.760
Here.

41:13.320 --> 41:15.120
Hold it here and twist downward.

41:16.920 --> 41:18.110
That's right.

41:19.570 --> 41:21.510
Our Tianxin is so clever.

41:26.030 --> 41:26.880
Zhen,

41:26.320 --> 41:30.230
[By Li Zhen]

41:27.280 --> 41:30.150
the ink-making methods of Li Ink
have been compiled and preserved

41:30.150 --> 41:31.710
for the benefit of future generations.

41:31.710 --> 41:32.800
We, the Li family,

41:33.000 --> 41:34.860
have true strength of character.

41:42.280 --> 41:42.920
Good.

41:43.710 --> 41:47.480
You must diligently memorize
the Ink Canon and copy the Ink Scripture.

41:47.480 --> 41:49.810
You're always so energetic when playing,

41:49.840 --> 41:51.900
yet so sleepy when it's time to study.

41:52.310 --> 41:54.920
Each inkstick is painstakingly made.

41:54.960 --> 41:56.820
Make sure you cherish them, okay?

41:56.960 --> 41:58.710
Okay, okay.

42:52.080 --> 42:53.530
[Li Zhen honored the trust of her forebears
and restored the glory of Li Ink.]

42:53.530 --> 42:54.990
[She later withdrew into seclusion, where she devoted
herself to writing and passing on her knowledge.]

42:55.020 --> 42:56.680
[From the Wanli reign of the Ming dynasty onward,
Hui Ink was carried on by the Fang and Cheng lineages.]

42:56.680 --> 42:58.350
[Generations of master craftsmen followed in succession,
preserving the tradition without interruption.]

43:00.280 --> 43:03.940
[The End]
